{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, approach and check properties. If visible and grabbable, grab it, move to location and scan.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <SubTree ID = ScanForObject    />\"",
